OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FLive from the Chapel of the Old
OL,7,     FRoyal Naval College, Greenwich,
OL,8,     FLondon, with the Trinity Laban
OL,9,     FChapel Choir.
OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Cyril Scott
OL,11,     F3/5. Donald Macleod delves into
OL,12,     FCyril Scott's interest in
OL,13,     Fmysticism and occultism, including
OL,14,     Fhis clairvoyant connection with
OL,15,     FMahatma Koot Hoomi.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,18,     Fmusic from violinist Viktoria
OL,19,     FMullova and pianist Alasdair
OL,20,     FBeatson, and speaks to baritone
OL,21,     FChristian Gerhaher about singing
OL,22,     Fin Parsifal.
